      "version": "0.1.2-draft",
      "section": "Lifecycle concepts are separate > Verification and evidence",
      "concept": "Evidence",
      "quote": "Evidence. Records a decision, transition, invocation, execution or effect. Ending authority does not by itself erase or invalidate evidence of earlier events.",
